    <statement><p>A lamp has two bulbs, each of a type with an average lifetime of 4 hours.  The
probability density function for the lifetime of a bulb is <m>f(t) = \frac{1}{4}
e^{-t/4}, t \geq 0</m>.</p>
<p>What is the probability that both of the bulbs will fail within 5 hours?</p>
<p><fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
